/* invariant: buffer must always be null-terminated */
if (!buf || buf[len] != '\0') return -EINVAL;
return parse(buf, len);

Which of these feature flags are still referenced anywhere in the diff below? flags: always_on_search, never_cache_avatars, must_verify_email.
- if (flags.always_on_search) renderSearch();
+ renderSearch();

